# LuxOS - sablona softwaru "Kazdodenni pouziti" (luxos-install TEMPLATES=everyday)
# Format: @klic hodnota = popis sablony; ostatni radky = baliky z repozitaru Arch/LuxOS.
#   balik ?a,b    jen kdyz je v systemu nainstalovany nektery z baliku a, b (napr. ovladac)
#   balik ?!a,b   jen kdyz neni nainstalovany zadny z nich
#   %lang% / %lang_%  jazyk systemu (cs_CZ -> cs-cz nebo cs / cs_cz nebo cs); balik se
#                     pouzije, jen pokud existuje (jinak se tise vynecha)
@name Everyday
@description Office suite, e-mail, a media player with all common codecs, a password manager, PDF tools, disk tools and more fonts for documents.
@apps LibreOffice · Thunderbird · VLC · KeePassXC · PDF Arranger · Disks · Transmission
@icon x-office-document
@order 10
# priblizna velikost stahovani v MB nad zakladni system (odhad podle repozitaru 2026-10)
@download 760
# Kancelar a posta
libreoffice-fresh
libreoffice-fresh-%lang%
hunspell-%lang_%
hyphen-%lang_%
thunderbird
thunderbird-i18n-%lang%
galculator
pdfarranger
# Multimedia: prehravac a kodeky (H.264/H.265, AAC, DVD titulky apod. i v prohlizeci a Celluloidu)
vlc
vlc-plugins-all
gst-libav
gst-plugins-bad
gst-plugins-ugly
# Hesla, disky, stahovani
keepassxc
gnome-disk-utility
baobab
transmission-gtk
# Pisma pro dokumenty (kompatibilni s Office, CJK, emoji uz je v zakladu)
ttf-dejavu
ttf-carlito
ttf-caladea
noto-fonts-cjk
